{"id":"weile","lemma":"Weile","pos":"noun","rank":698,"glosses":["while (uncertain duration of time, period of time)"],"ipa":"/ˈvaɪ̯lə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/De-weile.ogg/De-weile.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Weile","plural":"Weilen"},"examples":[{"text":"Warte eine Weile.","en":"Wait a while.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/564269","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"warten"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du eine kleine Weile warten?","en":"Can you wait a little while?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"small, little, wee","l":"klein"},null,{"g":"to wait"}]},{"text":"Er stand dort eine Weile.","en":"He stood there for a while.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"there, yonder"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Könnt ihr noch eine Weile bleiben?","en":"Can you stay a while longer?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to remain"}]},{"text":"Du kennst mich schon eine Weile.","en":"You've known me for a while.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}